                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "In high-volatility weeks the model keeps its edge, but every method's error roughly doubles. A crisis does not make the model less useful than the alternative — it makes precision unavailable to anybody.\n\n",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Keep one horizon selected. Averaging skill across horizons mixes three different questions.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#6b7280"
                    }
